    "notes": "NVIDIA DGX Spark (GB10, sm_121), driver 580.173.02, CUDA 13.0, aarch64 Ubuntu 24.04, 121 GiB unified memory. ComfyUI 0.36.0 at commit 3dd559d81f745747cab884a3b9f5fd8867d79efe, torch 2.14.0+cu130, comfy-kitchen 0.2.35, transformers 5.17.0. Weights: Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors (DiT, int8_tensorwise + convrot Hadamard rotation, groupsize 256) with qwen3vl_8b_w4a8.safetensors (text encoder, asym_w4a8_int8, int4 packed as int8 with an fp8 per-group scale) and qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors. There is no w4a8 DiT; w4a8 exists only for the text encoder, which is why this cell's quant_id is w4a8-te and the DiT is the int8_convrot file. The model is selected inside the workflow, not on the command line, so the graph is part of the configuration: UNETLoader -> KSampler, CLIPLoader + VAELoader -> TextEncodeQwenImage21 -> KSampler, VAEDecode -> SaveImage, at cfg 1, euler, simple, denoise 1, with the encode node's resolution left at its default 1024. Ambient temperature unknown."
